      <span style="background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.12); color: #f59e0b; border: 1px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.35); padding: 4px 14px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 14px;">BOOKING TIMELINE</span>
      <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.35; margin-bottom: 18px;">Strategic Booking Windows, Off-Peak Scheduling &amp; Payment Milestones for Car Transport Charge From Gorakhpur To Delhi</h2>
      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p>When you need to ship a vehicle from Gorakhpur to Delhi, the cost can quickly add up. By timing your booking and structuring payments, you can trim the final invoice without compromising service quality. Below are practical tactics that help you save on the transport charge.</p>

<p><strong>Mid‑Month vs. Month‑End Moves</strong></p>
<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">Demand for car transport peaks at the end of each month when many owners align deliveries with payroll cycles.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 16px 0 20px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;"><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>Mid‑month slots (roughly the 10th to 20th) are typically less crowded, giving carriers more flexibility and lower rates.</span></li><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>If your schedule permits, aim for a mid‑month departure; carriers often offer 5% to 10% discounts for these off‑peak windows.</span></li></ul>

<p><strong>Advance Reservation Discounts</strong></p>
<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">Book at least 30 days ahead to secure the lowest quote.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 16px 0 20px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;"><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>Reputable firms run early‑bird promotions—up to 15% off the base rate—if you confirm before the first week of the month.</span></li><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>Look for coupon codes on the carrier’s website, or ask the broker about seasonal rebates.</span></li><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>A simple phone call can uncover hidden savings that aren’t listed online.</span></li></ul>

<p><strong>Milestone Payment Schedules</strong></p>
<p>Instead of paying the full amount upfront, negotiate a staged payment plan: 30% deposit, 30% midway, and 40% upon arrival. This spreads the cost, reduces cash‑flow pressure, and often triggers a small discount on the final balance. Some carriers even waive the deposit if you commit to a future booking or refer a friend.</p>

<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">When you combine these strategies—choosing a mid‑month window, leveraging early‑bird discounts, and splitting payments—you can lower the total transport charge by 10% to 20%.</p>
